Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.21,0:00:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the same dark cloud that\Nsurrounded us during my duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.57,0:01:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That means my brother and Marek\Nare fighting a shadow duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.75,0:01:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You could use a rest, little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And you could use a haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.05,0:01:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to these dark energy\Nstreams, every time your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters are attacked your\Nbody is drained of strength so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the deal with that\Ncard marrick stuck in joey's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Graveyard. It removes one card\Nfrom Joey's hand with every
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,turn some of his best cards\Ncan be destroyed before he
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,gets to use them it's my move
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.85,0:01:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,farewell ah my coffin seller
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,trap card now i have several\Ntraps on the field just
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.17,0:02:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting to be triggered by\None of his pathetic monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do now is lure this fool\Ninto attacking me, and he's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.91,0:02:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I place two cards face down,\Nand now I'll end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't Freak Boy attacking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got his Dark on the field in attack\Nmode, and no cards left in his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, not that my cards are\Nanything to brag about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I need a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my insect queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's a high-level card, I gotta\Nsacrifice two monsters to play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too risky right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Baby Dragon in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet at least one of his\Nface-down cards is a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as I attack,\Nhe'll spring it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows are growing\Nimpatient, little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:03:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you too frightened to attack me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.43,0:03:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you fear my three-faced down cards
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and the possible devastation\Nthey could cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Marek bully me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him push you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he wants you to attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't, because he'll just\Nactivate one of his trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do,\Njust sit around and wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.89,0:03:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm through waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Joey, don't attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he should attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for Joey to win, he must force\NMarek to reveal his traps right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Joey knows what Marek's cards are,\Nhe can devise a strategy to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket Warrior, activate invincible mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's precisely the move I\Nwanted you to make, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.55,0:03:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,For you have allowed me to\Nactivate my card of last will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.91,0:04:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can draw five cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like my hand is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now which of my new cards\Nshould I use against you first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've drawn my Egyptian god card, the\Nwinged dragon of Ra! Joey! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what cards you got, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.65,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still gonna mop the floor\Nwith that head of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, scapegoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate the trap\Ncard, Coffin Cellar! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now each time one of your\Nmonsters is sent to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,300 life points are\Ndeducted from your total.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember Help-O-Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that monster he put in my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It just took my insect queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the best card in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I lose 300 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've devised a foolproof\Nsystem of depleting your life
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,points each turn without\Nhaving to do anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.81,0:05:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey loses one card each turn, and if that\Ncard's a monster, he loses life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget that my plasma heal is\Nstill attached to your Panther Warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,which lowers its attack points even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My move, at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place this card\Nface down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:06:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll activate this Premature\NBurial. This allows me to summon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.29,0:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,any monster that resides in the\Ngraveyard What are you bringing back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I give up 800 life\Npoints, I shall revive Drilago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,from my card graveyard But\Nthere's still more Next,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sacrifice Brilago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.49,0:06:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can bring forth this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've summoned an unstoppable\Ncreature known as Legendary Fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.09,0:06:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's only got 1500 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know that things aren't\Nalways what they appear to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And just what do you mean by that, Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My beast gets stronger by\N700 attack points each turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now make your move, if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.05,0:07:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey still has way more life points\Nthan Marek does, so I'm not too worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.49,0:07:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that may be the case, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Life points aren't everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's totally got the\Nupper hand in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had my Jinzo, I\Ncould destroy all his traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But that card's in my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.89,0:07:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't draw something\Ngood now, I'm a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Wingard, he's too weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You look disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I'm disappointed about\Nis that I didn't kick your butt sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Little Wingard into...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the Trap Card, Nightmare Wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my Rocket Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pitiful little monster is now\Nheld captive by my nightmare wheel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.85,0:07:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,which means he can't\Nattack me or defend you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.45,0:07:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as my trap card\Nremains on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So basically, he's\Ncompletely useless to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pick up where I left off, summoning\NLittle Winged Dragon in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll switch my Panther Warrior into\Ndefense mode, so try and get me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Frame him, Plasma Eel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Weaken his panther and his body!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't tickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the fact that I'm losing or the\Nfact that I'm losing to Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't gain control of this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of the tournament and\NMarek advances to the final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And even worse, I won't\Nbe able to rescue mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful up there, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.69,0:08:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,or you're going to end up\Ntrapped in the Shadow Realm, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.51,0:08:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the duel continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:09:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot to mention that you lose 500\Nlife points every time my turn begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.61,0:09:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the special ability of my\NNightmare Wheel Trap Card. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, my Legendary\NFiend gained 700 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to feel his wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Legendary Fiend, attack\Nhis little wing guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time one of your\Nmonsters goes to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.77,0:09:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Coffin Cellar takes 300\Nof your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, although it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.49,0:09:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I unleash my\NMalevolent Catastrophe trap card,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,that fool will be devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:10:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,For once it's activated, every monster\Non the field will go to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all, thanks\Nto my Coffin Seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,trap card he'll lose\N300 life coins for every
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Creature that's destroyed,\Nthen I'll wipe out the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,rest of his life coins\Nwith my legendary fiend
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,this doesn't look good\Nnot from Joey at least
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.87,0:10:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,well I must say I'm not surprised time for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My comeback. It goes\NMaric's trap cards are
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,doing me in each one\Nis worse than the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess, like Yugi says, I gotta put\Nmy faith in the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.61,0:10:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you finally realize that\Nthere's no way you can win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,me, before long you'll be trapped\Nin the Shadow Realm, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll see how long
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you last before I banish\Nyou into the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move, Merrick, and you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The card I'm holding in\Nmy hand right now is going
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.01,0:11:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,to put an end to your entire\Ndueling strategy. You lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a card I like to call... Question!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Question?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This bad boy forces you\Nto guess which one of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,my monsters is at the\Nbottom of my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you guess right, that\Nmonster is out of the game for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you mess up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it gets summoned to the field and I can\Nuse it to take control of this tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.37,0:11:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a guess, tough guy. I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst that could happen is\Nyou guess wrong and I crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I must remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of his monsters did I destroy first?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it was that\Nalligator sword of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.45,0:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that card was already\Nremoved from his graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:12:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've destroyed so many of Joey's monsters,\NI can't remember which one was first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it was one of the cards my\NHelp-O-Emma destroyed, but which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.03,0:12:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in trouble. Want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.51,0:12:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The first card that went to my graveyard\Nwas chosen randomly by your Help-O-Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.67,0:12:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can remember\Nthe first monster you destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,because you never saw which one it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How much time left, folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Five seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Five, four, three, two, one. Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stunned silence was not the\Nanswer we were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The joke will be on him\Nwhen my catastrophic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.93,0:12:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,trap car destroys every\Nmonster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You guessed wrong, so I\Nget to summon this! Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.49,0:12:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:12:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet you know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.01,0:13:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to say goodbye to every\Ntrap card you have on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo, strut your stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I just turned your entire game\Nplan completely upside down,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.83,0:13:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, and it serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, man. It's all you. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the use of his trap cards,\NMerrick needs a new strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In a bad mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.75,0:13:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be mad too if I were\Non the other side of Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.01,0:13:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the first monster\NI won at Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, my Jinzo and my Locator card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry about that cheating thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat me fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And next time we duel,\NI'm playing totally legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.57,0:13:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No more cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.09,0:13:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold you to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, smell you\Nlater, Robo-Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, we're a lot alike, Esper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.91,0:14:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got your brothers, and\NI've got my sister and my pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're all there to support\Neach other when we need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we got that, nobody loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.69,0:14:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't alone back then,\Nand I'm not alone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I got my and my sister\NSerenity to inspire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I got the rest of the\Ngang down there cheering me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.79,0:14:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you beat Merrick, he's out of the\Ntournament and the world is saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not through with you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you still have a monster on\Nthe field protecting your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's just not gonna work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me start things off by switching\Nmy baby dragon into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And Panther Warrior II.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, go Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.61,0:14:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow away his legendary thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.59,0:15:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.53,0:15:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey has destroyed all of\NMerrick's monsters If he
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,can successfully attack\NMerrick's life points directly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll win the duel
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you the man, Joey Come on, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,put this evil creep right\Nin his place Hey, Seto,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.05,0:15:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Joey may win after all.\NI'll only believe that when I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, never underestimate a duelist\Nwho holds an Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.73,0:15:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My, I'm coming to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark wall of wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.85,0:15:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick blocked the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Help-O-Ever destroys\Nanother card from your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.47,0:16:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not all, little Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Plasma Eel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Drain his panther!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like I don't need\Nmonsters to bring you to your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought you could\Ndefeat me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have known that's no easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, your little friend\NMai made the very same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know well what fate befell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.67,0:16:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,An eternity of darkness and despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll soon join her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.55,0:16:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever your mind is, my\Nbrother's gonna get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And so is Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:17:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My move. Just what I needed. I'm about
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,to call forth an extremely powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,beast it's an eight star monster known\Nas lava golem slow down there cowboy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't play a monster that strong\Nwithout making a sacrifice first
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.35,0:17:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,how perceptive of you i have every\Nintention Listen of making a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Lava Golem allows me to sacrifice two\Nmonsters on your side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.61,0:17:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I said Lava Golem stays\Non your side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.75,0:17:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be pleased to receive\Na monster with 3,000 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean this thing is mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster may belong to Joey\Nnow, but it comes with a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't get it, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Lava Golem is now Wheeler's monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.81,0:17:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so all of its weaknesses\Nbecome Wheeler's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.27,0:17:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster's beginning to melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Each turn, Lava Golem melts\Nand you lose life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have packed my sunscreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that your Jinzo is\Nback in the card graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can set as many traps as I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll place this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, why don't you\Nattack me with your monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He does have 3,000 attack points, which\Nis more than enough to wipe me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are you waiting for? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, there's not\Nmuch else you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, think this through, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.52,0:18:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though Lava Golem causes\NJoey to lose life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,it still has 3,000 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,which makes it powerful enough\Nto help Joey win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So why would Merrick give it to Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.79,0:18:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:18:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you beginning to sweat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite hot inside Lava Golem's cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Better make a move before your\Nmonster turns up the heat even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.93,0:19:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's fighting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.75,0:19:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting way too hot in this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.09,0:19:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta do something right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't really have much\Nof a choice, little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh it out, freak boy. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you wanted to rescue\NMai from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.47,0:19:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now's your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me and save your friend.
